bt_bb_section66f63f5de87ff" class="bt_bb_section bt_bb_color_scheme_1 bt_bb_layout_boxed_1200 bt_bb_vertical_align_top bt_bb_top_spacing_none bt_bb_bottom_spacing_small" style="background: transparent;; --section-primary-color:#ffffff; --section-secondary-color:#191919;" data-bt-override-class="{&quot;bt_bb_top_spacing_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_top_spacing_none&quot;,&quot;xxl&quot;:&quot;none&quot;},&quot;bt_bb_bottom_spacing_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_bottom_spacing_small&quot;,&quot;xxl&quot;:&quot;small&quot;}}"><div class="bt_bb_port"><div class="bt_bb_cell"><div class="bt_bb_cell_inner"><div data-bb-version="5.0.1" class="bt_bb_row  bt_bb_hidden_xs bt_bb_hidden_ms bt_bb_hidden_sm bt_bb_hidden_md bt_bb_hidden_lg bt_bb_hidden_xl" data-bt-override-class="{}" data-structure="12"><div class="bt_bb_row_holder"><div class="bt_bb_column col-xxl-12 col-xl-12 bt_bb_vertical_align_top bt_bb_align_left bt_bb_padding_normal" data-width="12" data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_column_content"><div class="bt_bb_raw_content"><p style="color: white; background: red; padding: 20px;text-align: center; border-radius: 3px;">
<span style="font-size:18px">𝑫𝒆𝒂𝒓 𝑪𝒊𝒕𝒊𝒛𝒆𝒏𝒔</span><br>
NADRA has planned a system upgrade activity on June 19, 2024, from 10am to 12pm (2 hours). Considering the public interest, the activity has been planned during Eid holidays. However, Pak ID Mobile App and Pak ID Web Portal (<a style="color:white" href="https://id.nadra.gov.pk/" target="_blank">https://id.nadra.gov.pk</a>) will be unavailable during these hours. 
We regret any inconvenience you may experience.
</p></div><div data-bb-version="4.7.7" class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_top_spacing_normal bt_bb_bottom_spacing_normal" data-bt-override-class="{&quot;bt_bb_top_spacing_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_top_spacing_normal&quot;,&quot;xxl&quot;:&quot;normal&quot;},&quot;bt_bb_bottom_spacing_&quot;:{&quot;current_class&quot;:&quot;bt_bb_bottom_spacing_normal&quot;,&quot;xxl&quot;:&quot;normal&quot;}}"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-bb-version="4.7.7" class="bt_bb_row " data-bt-override-class="{}" data-structure="12"><div class="bt_bb_row_holder"><div class="bt_bb_column col-xxl-12 col-xl-12 bt_bb_vertical_align_top bt_bb_align_left bt_bb_padding_normal" data-width="12" data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_column_content"><div class="bt_bb_raw_content"><!-- <p style='color: white; background: red; padding: 10px;text-align: center; border-radius: 3px;'>PAKID mobile app payment services will be unavailable from 10:00AM to 11:00AM on Jan 31, 2024 due to scheduled maintenance. Inconvenience regretted.</p> -->

